{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-08-17 HKT</p>\n\n<p>70歲的TVB資深演員陳榮峻與67歲太太吳香倫，是圈中出名的模範夫妻，二人均是8月生日，往年也是一起慶生。他們在早前大結局的《愛回家之開心速遞》飾演夫妻「譚道德」及「譚何容儀」，而劇中飾演譚家女兒譚育英（Bonnie）的林凱恩，原來同樣是8月壽星，今年三人齊齊敍舊慶生，場面熱鬧。</p>\n<h2>陳榮峻與吳香倫譜出黃昏戀</h2>\n<p>陳榮峻與吳香倫譜出「黃昏戀」並於2018年拉埋天窗。陳榮峻曾經歷喪妻之痛，直至2017年與吳香倫擦出愛火，兩人的戀情獲得了陳榮峻與亡妻所生的一女兩子全力支持。然而婚後的考驗卻接踵而來，吳香倫近年不幸被病魔折磨，確診患上罕見病「皮肌炎」，醫生發現她的肌肉酵素比常人高出數倍，伴隨嚴重的關節痛楚與手指腫脹。愛妻心切的陳榮峻最初以為太太只是過度勞累，後來見她雙手嚴重脫皮，又誤以為是患上「主婦手」，為此他主動孭下家中所有家務，生怕太太再受勞損，絕對是百分百的「愛妻號」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻黃昏戀修成正果。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e36ce981e13169d16482ce4d5797c97c/2023-07/chanwingchung430_118009961_934098903755997_4901286268029917196_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻喪妻5年，於2015年與吳香倫拍拖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbcfb31b927428912405c6b020360fb4/2023-05/unknown_107335031_287171282521328_3211814445639640065_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日陳榮峻、吳香倫與林凱恩一起慶祝生日，場面溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51a9d1209bb96edffcc3b7c106e3cc89/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774712556_18610277311044094_5013262127113851398_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻、吳香倫與林凱恩大擺鬼馬甫士合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da89a04144a41101fd3a67bccb064433/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774727163_18610277293044094_416302761543038516_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩俏皮地咬着蛋糕上的朱古力牌，十分可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce642ec44f3d8a3ac925364dd63202bc/2026-08/SaveClip_App_774886579_18610277347044094_4074705339295106116_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"生日蛋糕上，配以「譚氏一家幸福快樂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b63bba144ffd81573b398bfd15d8393/2026-08/SaveClip_App_775869476_18610277338044094_8868328150355895705_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻的婚禮有不少圈中人出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e9ce6ae6d23dde1b8bd6cd141f110e6/2023-07/_04_36963925_1821912914542557_8481315831156834304_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻在2017年盆菜宴向吳香倫求婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/332d50407be7ea5a577a0ac4f9ac8e47/2022-09/chan13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻與亡妻有有三名子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f9fb26ea050693b1af69ca92542dd32/2023-05/unknown_69361013_394459411252889_2850065160913946464_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻再婚獲得三名子女支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f661a8604ad5b4e56b9f94fbca31ede/2023-05/unknown_68689482_140677560485665_6728045879633974959_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻一家經常結伴出外活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4f2b2d146d9c5e2e81232015ce11ee2/2023-07/chanwingchung430_96947197_179174613309582_4645276061744748358_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻與吳香倫婚後十分恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/970c4ce40c84cf7fe3a80391747a1563/2023-05/unknown_70515381_156482412221901_7110529925324907015_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳香倫之前身體未如理想，令陳榮峻擱置北上大計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cce2020263751d76dea8f8c078bd811d/2023-05/%E5%90%B3%E9%A6%99%E5%80%AB%28%E5%8E%BB%E5%B9%B45%E6%9C%88%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳香倫近年患病，陳榮峻不離不棄照顧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d84dab85294456266007c43f86fee6a5/2023-05/unknown_91120403_203516970914355_8433467694021775550_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻與子女感情好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07012e6d6b71a799891b25188be4c819/2023-07/chanwingchun0822_107102503_297813288132724_6885711188612789687_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻曾曝光父女照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b1072c21e05ac484c7958326ae976f8/2023-07/chanwingchun0822_361902437_10231487179269492_2856137550113185850_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻曾分享與吳香倫結婚周年照片，女兒返港送二人手機做禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ca274b92cea41125d06411d223097d3/2024-03/358620131_10226438343339116_623198721754797717_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻曾分享女兒在新西蘭結婚的照片，吳香倫都有陪伴出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cef22c1b24a9ff3d754f84ed9245f5aa/2024-03/chanwingchun0822_1710566215_3324792847738873796_9010229782.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻的女兒出閣之喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44e3ef4f1b2cab3a4eb63fed5a58fe0f/2024-03/chanwingchun0822_1710566215_3324792847747409221_9010229782.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻搞笑指自己穿得隆重像新郎哥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f625deb2275718dff5c34e39bc1657d8/2024-03/chanwingchun0822_1710566215_3324792847873276322_9010229782.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻宣布榮升做公公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32c4fc1d0b716ece52e6725c5d6d96af/2024-12/chanwingchun0822_1734846182_3528467980931240395_9010229782.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳香倫貼上抱B相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80065af815dd0e399d5cd1ac285d0492/2024-12/helen_ngheunglun_1735047288_3530154979551350167_2250646324.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻有孫萬事足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/633644b0dfe11d0e34ad44b78e77cf5a/2024-12/helen_ngheunglun_1735047288_3530154979727620574_2250646324.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻夫婦開心抱孫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b349b2104044f7929f1ac8b30458f9f/2024-12/helen_ngheunglun_1735047288_3530154979844957952_2250646324.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳香倫早前於社交網分享兩公婆在新西蘭的生活照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea1b85fac3b580946d7d8e928ee5ea19/2024-03/helen_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻（左）夫婦在當地四處遊覽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f174bebaff251c17a19896a13a9428f8/2024-03/helen_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻（左）夫婦一起坐纜車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccf0903a62e0f2a5e37049074b990fbe/2024-03/helen_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳榮峻（後右二）的女婿廬山真面目曝光！女兒Jessica（前右）的老公（前中）戴上Cap帽，似乎也是高大健碩一族，與Jessica相當匹配。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cf23e32c79e119a14f62f627f751931/2024-03/helen_10.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳香倫患罕見病皮肌炎</h2>\n<p>直至最終的驗血報告出爐，證實吳香倫體內的病菌正攻擊她的皮膚、心臟、腦部及肺部，令她整個人陷入極度疲憊的狀態。幸運的是，醫生表示病情發現得早，所感染的並非最惡劣的病菌，才令他們稍稍放下心頭大石。不過這個罕見病仍導致吳香倫有三分之一的肺部出現纖維化。為了對抗病魔，醫生建議她必須依靠帶氧運動來幫助肺部功能恢復。為此陳榮峻不離不棄地肩負起貼身照顧愛妻的重任，現在兩人經常結伴行山，戲裡戲外也是一對恩愛夫妻。</p>\n<img alt=\"《愛回家》「安Bon」CP深受粉絲歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b94bf8625cfffe07151b766960c4c2b/2022-10/1_21.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩憑住《 愛．回家》的清純形象成功入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ba1c68e5713ffb249136e96a6109e2a/2022-10/IG%20%285%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在《愛．回家》飾演「譚道德」的女兒Bonnie。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa225fb34cf25c028b3785a558dc5d18/2022-10/lovegohome%20%281%29_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安仔決定放下過去與見Bonnie「離婚」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb310ef0becfc9bab69898d01d987fc3/2026-08/02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安仔因捨不得，竟想出各種古靈精怪理由拖延辦理離婚手續。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5ff883b9356bdb8d889c80c5b81ff2f/2026-08/06_3_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"安仔並送上最真誠卻又最揪心的祝福：「原來大個仔唔單止要學識承擔，仲要學識放低唔屬於自己嘅嘢」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07d767a954c9093fc183d5f2bdc3416e/2026-08/07_3_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一臉感動的Bonnie亦強忍淚水哽咽回應：「咁我都祝福你，金城安，以後都要幸福快樂，多謝你安仔。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ebea6d289aa61ec7b61427dc6718c10/2026-08/09_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「結婚嗰陣錫一啖，離婚嗰陣又有個Goodbye Kiss，咁對我哋嘅婚姻嚟講，都叫做有始有終吖」、\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47ee816685d44c704274e41c3eddd285/2026-08/10_0_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在IG發放相關福利圖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3d56a15071ad800aae24a0ca71b9556/2026-04/5_9_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩一對黑絲長腿引死人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e4427c5b58c190011f106d1dd54b2f6/2026-04/6_16_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩好嬌俏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22b1b914302f0827a77db0f130cd102f/2026-04/7_14_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩笑容甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb841a1211a305e46543b00a82c2441b/2022-12/IRISLAM27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩早前去希臘旅行，晒罕見性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa7ff603494905d716506a39453f8ce4/2024-12/466161929_18464041936044094_3185764997670799864_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩露胸前春光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe8c03ff0856f7e56e80a9870ae0555c/2024-12/466146566_18464041915044094_1165099853252162032_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩狂ig狂吸fans。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0e9dfc258fd899915a13a4a4aa585bc/2022-12/IRISLAM26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩好sweet。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27df1d385cdd29c80963fcf4e0960952/2022-12/IRISLAM23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩經常分享靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94a13279602c2d924f653dae9010571c/2022-12/IRISLAM20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩身材姣好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/254af53b817f783e8632237093530ccd/2022-12/IRISLAM19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩有不少粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b0abe831a02a7d52f0053ab50c92ec5/2022-12/IRISLAM13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩身材好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05bffd0c9c314df7b47e5bd957fcb197/2022-12/IRISLAM11.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T05:19:47.922506+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":624,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}